// The pointer moving. Every move goes to the camera (a pan in progress follows
// it, and the wheel zooms about where the pointer last was) and always asks for a
// new picture, since a tooltip follows the pointer. A held block becomes a drag
// when the pointer has gone more than conf.id's bkk_c_slop from where it was
// pressed, and not before, so a click on a literal is not a drag.

editor_motion(string[][] editor_string_session, int[][] editor_matrix_session, int[][] editor_matrix_layout, int editor_integer_x, int editor_integer_y, int editor_integer_mask) {
  int[] bel_state = editor_matrix_session[(import constant_y_state)];
